<div class="chapter_content content" id="7684666_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[HISTORY: Adopted by the Common Council of the City of Albany 7-18-1983 by L.L. No. 2-1983 as Ch. XXIII of the 1983 Code. Amendments noted where applicable.]</div><aside class="chapterrefblock"><h2 class="generalReferencesTitle">GENERAL REFERENCES</h2><div class="para">Sewers — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7684007" href="7684007#7684007">299</a>.</div><div class="para">Sidewalk and outdoor cafes — See Ch. 303.</div><div class="para">Water and waterways — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7686107" href="7686107#7686107">371</a>.</div><div class="para">Zoning — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="38067105" href="38067105#38067105">375</a>.</div></aside><div class="footnotes"></div></div>


